{"id":"wb-7-1076","name":"罗星塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"罗星塔","text":"罗星塔（平话字：Lò̤-sĭng-ták），俗称磨心塔，位于中华人民共和国福建省福州市马尾区闽江北岸的罗星山上，是明代建筑的楼阁式石塔。相传最初由宋代柳七娘为亡夫祈求冥福所建，故又名七娘塔。罗星塔下是著名的马尾港，故罗星塔也常作为航标。1985年被列为福建省文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BD%97%E6%98%9F%E5%A1%94","revisionId":94352114,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94352114","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f9815a9c6844c81fb05d9a35.jpg","title":"罗星塔与柳七娘.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BD%97%E6%98%9F%E5%A1%94%E4%B8%8E%E6%9F%B3%E4%B8%83%E5%A8%98.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b3/%E7%BD%97%E6%98%9F%E5%A1%94%E4%B8%8E%E6%9F%B3%E4%B8%83%E5%A8%98.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Sunatnight","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"该照片的内容为中国全国重点文物保护单位。编号： CNFJ-591-090","width":320,"height":483}}